@ImAI = https://localhost:7106

### Create anonymous session first; enable your HTTP client's cookie jar
POST {{ImAI}}/api/sessions

### Validate current cookie (no body/token in JSON)
POST {{ImAI}}/api/sessions/validate

### Refresh cookie; save the updated Set-Cookie automatically
POST {{ImAI}}/api/sessions/refresh

### AI chat; the cookie jar attaches the session cookie
POST {{ImAI}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"How does retrieval work?"}

### Existing conversation
POST {{ImAI}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"Explain more.","conversationId":"5d15c0eb-1988-40da-b4df-b67a435f1c94"}

### Health (public)
GET {{ImAI}}/health
